Description: Real-time weather station monitoring application
 Weather Station Monitor is a Qt-based desktop application that monitors
 weather data from multiple locations using the OpenWeatherMap API.
 .
 Features:
  - Monitor 5 cities simultaneously (Zocca, Rome, Paris, London, New York)
  - Real-time temperature, humidity, pressure, and wind data
  - Interactive charts with historical data visualization
  - Multi-threaded architecture for concurrent API calls
  - MySQL database for data persistence
  - Python-powered analytics and statistics
  - Automatic refresh every 5 minutes
  - Beautiful Qt5-based user interface
